	 Client: Ahead StudioYear: 2025
 Role: Brand Identity, Art Direction, Social Media
Art direction and visual identity for a newly founded digital product studio.
Defined and delivered the brand system solo, from concept to launch in 2 weeks, with full production readiness achieved within 1 month. Established a modular visual language applied across website, motion templates, pitch decks, social media, and advertising assets.

Directed the creation of 50+ production-ready assets, including 15+ social media templates, a pitch deck system ​(Keynote / Google Slides), and a flexible grid enabling fast content generation and long-term consistency.
Supported brand launch and early growth phase. The identity remains active and continues to evolve within a 4-person studio team
